<view class="screen">
  <view class="eyebrow">YOUR OWN PACE</view><view class="title">我的</view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="account-icon">轻</view><view class="heading">{{profile ? '微信身份已验证' : '欢迎使用轻体计划'}}</view><view class="muted space">免登录也能计算营养、记录饮食和打卡。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{profile}}"><view class="muted space">账号编号：{{profile.accountId}}</view><button class="secondary space" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view>
    <block wx:else><view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="notice">账号服务暂未开放。当前功能可继续免登录使用。</view><checkbox-group bindchange="onConsent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="account" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#268b5e" /><text>我已阅读下方账号说明，同意使用微信身份标识完成登录验证。</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!ready || !agreed || busy}}" bindtap="login">微信登录</button></block>
    <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="muted space">{{message}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="heading">账号与记录说明</view><view class="muted space">登录用于验证微信身份，不要求手机号、昵称或头像。账号编号不作为数据访问凭证。</view><view class="muted space">登录后可手动备份和恢复饮食、体重、打卡、自定义食物、常用餐及健康设置。云端记录不会自动覆盖本机；恢复前会再次确认。退出登录仍保留本机记录。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{profile}}" class="panel"><view class="heading">云备份</view><view class="muted space">备份会用当前本机记录更新该微信账号的云端副本。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{backupMeta}}" class="preview">最近备份：{{backupMeta.label}}（北京时间）</view>
    <button class="primary space" loading="{{backupBusy}}" disabled="{{backupBusy}}" bindtap="backupNow">备份本机记录到云端</button>
    <button class="secondary space" loading="{{backupBusy}}" disabled="{{backupBusy || !backupMeta}}" bindtap="restoreFromCloud">从云端恢复到本机</button>
    <view wx:if="{{backupMessage}}" class="muted space">{{backupMessage}}</view>
  </view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="goToday">回到今日，记录一餐</button>
  <view class="panel"><view class="heading">打卡提醒</view><view class="muted space">按北京时间，临近所选时间检查打卡状态。未打卡才提醒；每次主动订阅安排一次，不是永久每日推送。若今天已过提醒时间或已同步打卡，则安排明天。</view>
    <view class="label">希望收到提醒的时间</view><picker mode="time" value="{{reminderTime}}" bindchange="onReminderTime"><view class="select">{{reminderTime}}（北京时间） ▾</view></picker>
    <view wx:if="{{!reminderReady}}" class="notice">微信推送尚未开通，目前只能保存时间偏好，关闭小程序后不会收到通知。</view>
    <view class="muted space">点击订阅并在微信弹窗同意后，会将提醒时间和当天是否打卡同步到云端，用于跳过已完成日期；不上传食物明细或体重。离线打卡未同步时仍可能收到消息。系统约每分钟检查一次，送达时间可能延迟。</view>
    <button class="primary space" disabled="{{!reminderReady || reminderBusy}}" loading="{{reminderBusy}}" bindtap="subscribeReminder">订阅下一次未打卡提醒</button>
    <view wx:if="{{reminderJob}}" class="preview">{{reminderJob.date}} {{reminderJob.time}} · {{reminderJob.label}}</view>
    <button wx:if="{{reminderReady}}" class="secondary space" disabled="{{reminderBusy}}" bindtap="cancelReminder">取消待发送提醒</button>
    <view wx:if="{{reminderMessage}}" class="muted space">{{reminderMessage}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
